{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40534","headline":"及第後呈朝中知己 · 李旭","name":"及第後呈朝中知己","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"凌晨晓鼓奏嘉音，雷拥龙迎出陆沈。\n金榜高悬当玉阙，锦衣即着到家林。\n真珠每被尘泥陷，病鹤多遭蝼蚁侵。\n今日始知天有意，还教雪得一生心。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李旭","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_40534.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40534","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}